#
# Cross-platform descriptor table infrastructure. On x86-64 this is the Global
# Descriptor Table (GDT) loaded via lgdt. On AArch64 this maps to the exception
# level configuration loaded via VBAR_EL1. Data structures are architecture-neutral;
# only the load instruction uses arch-block asm.
